# Architecture memory

> **Adopter note:** this file is the always-on "never-forget" page — the facts
> an agent must not relearn mid-task. Keep the section shapes; replace the
> example content with your project's stack, layout, and authz model. Sections
> marked *(example)* show the shape a real answer takes.

**Plan:** `docs/architecture-plan.md` (read your slice's section, never paste).
**Living docs:** `docs/overview.md`, `docs/helpers-reference.md`,
`docs/sitemap.md` — search them when implementing (never read them whole) and
keep the entries you change current (`rules/04-rewrite-docs.mdc`). **New
code:** `app/`. **Legacy reference:** `legacy/` = behavior reference, not the
